        <activityName xml:lang="en">Liquefied petroleum gas, at service station</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Liquefied petroleum gas, at service station
The LPG production mix represents the average of 1999 until 2008 and is based on Swiss trade statistics.;
UUID: 25d12163-8bd4-3937-96a3-eb46641aba34
Dataset includes LPG production and distribution. Filling station is considered. Losses at loading, unloading and refuelling are included.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: Average data for the used technology
Time period: Nicht spezifiziert
Production volume: Total LPG consumption in 2008 for transport services was 5000 tons.
Sampling: statistics, company data 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_25d12163-8bd4-3937-96a3-eb46641aba34.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
